// Animated 3D Parallax: a 300² card that tilts in 3D toward the finger, its logo tilting after
// it on a looser spring (the lag is the parallax). RN: src/animations/animated-3d-parallax
// (index.tsx, hooks/use-3d-rotation-style.ts). The card, its shadow, the logo, the pan and both
// springs are Rust: gpu/src/animated_3d_parallax.rs (on styles.container's #17202A).

component Animated3dParallax
  view
    canvas surface=animated_3d_parallax() position="absolute" top=0 left=0 width="100%" height="100%"
      background-color="#17202A" touch-action="none" testId="parallax-canvas"
      aria-label="Card: drag to tilt"
